      "description": "A scene where a woman displays an exaggerated expression of shock or disbelief, visually reacting to the text overlay that reads 'a stork might bring you a baby but a swallow never will.' The woman's wide eyes, pouting lips, and direct gaze at the camera convey comedic surprise, which is central to the meme's humor and intent.",
